h","spans":[{"id":"spn-398","text":"Six capability primitives: "},{"id":"spn-399","marks":["code"],"text":"&memory"},{"id":"spn-400","text":", "},{"id":"spn-401","marks":["code"],"text":"&reason"},{"id":"spn-402","text":", "},{"id":"spn-403","marks":["code"],"text":"&time"},{"id":"spn-404","text":", "},{"id":"spn-405","marks":["code"],"text":"&space"},{"id":"spn-406","text":", "},{"id":"spn-407","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-408","text":", "},{"id":"spn-409","marks":["code"],"text":"&govern"},{"id":"spn-410","text":" Two composition operators: "},{"id":"spn-411","marks":["code"],"text":"&"},{"id":"spn-412","text":" (combine) and "},{"id":"spn-413","marks":["code"],"text":"|>"},{"id":"spn-414","text":" (pipeline) Capabilities are interfaces, providers are implementations. [&] does not replace MCP or A2A — it compiles into them."}]},{"id":"blk-220","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-415","marks":["code"],"text":"&body"},{"id":"spn-416","text":" is the sensorimotor primitive (added in draft v0.1.0) describing the agent's instantiation in an environment — perception, typed action, affordance enumeration, state encoding for replay. See GRASP for the behavioral loop that consumes "},{"id":"spn-417","marks":["code"],"text":"&body.*"},{"id":"spn-418","text":"."}]},{"id":"blk-221","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-419","text":"Schema targets"}]},{"id":"blk-222","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-420","text":"JSON Schema draft 2020-12. Prefer explicit validation rules over descriptions."}]}],"edges":[],"id":"bagaaierams2wxnuqm5bgkxzeykdz32dp62n6ouiybcoaeogxnsnyc7wvjpaq","vocabulary":"ampersand.docs.fs.v1"}